# ── Base Sepolia RPC ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public fallback (rate-limited): https://sepolia.base.org
# Get a free key: https://www.alchemy.com or https://www.infura.io
RPC_URL=https://sepolia.base.org

# ── Test Safe ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set after deploying your test Safe in Phase 2.
# SAFE_ADDRESS=0x...

# ── Executor signer (Phase 1+) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TESTNET ONLY — never use a key that controls real funds.
# This key is scoped on-chain (Zodiac Roles) to USDC transfers to
# whitelisted addresses only. The LLM never sees or uses this key.
# EXECUTOR_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# ── Owner / mandate signer (Phase 1+) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Signs EIP-712 mandates. Separate from executor for least-privilege.
# SIGNER_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# ── LLM API key (Phase 4+) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
